                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "一束花能撐多久，\n要看它離開土地時\n被怎麼對待。",
                  "lineHeight": 1.35,
                  "fontFamily": "$serif",
                  "fontSize": 52,
                  "fontWeight": "700"
                },
                {
                  "type": "frame",
                  "id": "QtN98",
                  "name": "Story Columns",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "gap": 40,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "b2dfHn",
                      "name": "Story Para",
                      "fill": "$stem",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "花漾生活成立於 2020 年。我們每週兩次到花市與產地挑選花材，只收當天剪下的花，回到工作室後立刻吸水、去刺、修葉。",
                      "lineHeight": 2,
                      "fontFamily": "$serif",
                      "fontSize": 16,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "id": "BGQS3",
                      "name": "Story Para",
                      "fill": "$stem",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "每一束花都由同一位花藝師從頭綁到尾，附上照顧小卡：多久換一次水、該剪掉哪一段莖，讓花在你家多留幾天。",
                      "lineHeight": 2,
                      "fontFamily": "$serif",
                      "fontSize": 16,
                      "fontWeight": "normal"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "HMxO0",
                  "name": "Byline",
                  "fill": "$ink",
                  "content": "主理花藝師  林予晴",
                  "fontFamily": "$sans",
                  "fontSize": 14,
                  "fontWeight": "500"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
